{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e7d3c1b0-9a8f-4e7d-bc1a-2f3e4d5c6b7a",
    "name": "Content + Expense Category + Expense Management",
    "description": "Postman collection for **`/api/content-management`**, **`/api/expense-category-management`**, **`/api/expense-management`**, plus **`/api/state`**, **`/api/city`**, **`/api/area`** (see `server.js`).\n\n**Setup:** Set **`{{baseUrl}}`** (e.g. `http://localhost:5001` or `https://…execute-api…/staging`). Run **Login** to set **`{{token}}`**. Set **`{{franchiseId}}`** to a real franchise ObjectId before expense category / expense calls.\n\n**State / City / Area:** Run **State → Create** first (sets **`stateId`** and **`stateNameForImport`**), then **City → Create** (**`cityId`**), then **Area → Create** (**`areaId`**). Duplicate **name** on create/update returns **409** (trim + case-insensitive for state/city; area name unique **per city**).\n\n**Dashboard counts:** **`POST /api/getCount`** with body `type` = **`content-management`**, **`expenses`**, or **`settings-expense-categories`** (see `count_controller.js` → `resolveCountType`).\n\n**Variables:** Expense category **Create** saves **`{{expenseCategoryId}}`** (parent category document) and **`{{expenseSubcategoryId}}`** for **`POST /api/expense-management/create`** — these names avoid clashing with catalogue **`categoryId`** used elsewhere.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 — Auth & health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "try {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j && j.record && j.record.auth_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.record.auth_token);",
                  "  }",
                  "} catch (e) {}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"device_token\": \"{{deviceToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Saves JWT to collection variable **`token`**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "No auth."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
